#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:2
msgid "network interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:4
msgid "The `network` interface allows client access to the network."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:7
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:9
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`** : "
"yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:9
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:11
msgid ""
"The `network` interface allows all outbound network access from the "
"application as a client. Should the application bind to a port, for example "
"to run a server, then the {ref}`network-bind <interfaces-network-bind-"
"interface>` interface should also be used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:13
msgid ""
"Both `network` and `network-bind` interfaces are automatically connected on "
"installation, and require no additional store review to be used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:15
msgid "<h3 id='heading-code'>Code examples</h3>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:17
msgid ""
"apps:\n"
"  client:\n"
"    command: bin/client-application\n"
"    plugs:\n"
"      - network\n"
"  frontend:\n"
"    command: bin/server-application\n"
"    plugs:\n"
"      - network\n"
"      - network-bind\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:30
msgid ""
"Further network-related interfaces are typically not required, unless the "
"application needs to interrogate or control network interfaces, or manage "
"the local firewall. Most of these are not automatically connected, but can "
"be manually connected by the end user. In addition, the publisher may "
"request auto-connection of these interfaces via a snapcraft forum thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:32
msgid ""
"The test code for this interface can be found in the snapd repository: "
"<https://github.com/canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/"
"network_test.go>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/network-interface.md:35
msgid ""
"The source code for this interface is in the *snapd* repository: <https://"
"github.com/canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/network.go>"
msgstr ""
